WEBVTT

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:25.870
Saint Seiya

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:35.000
The Underworld.

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:37.820
The land of the dead, ruled by Hades.

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:43.870
The battle of the young
warriors of hope escalates.

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:48.060
They are at the mercy of destiny.

00:02:11.430 --> 00:02:12.790
Athena.

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:14.960
Hades.

00:02:15.660 --> 00:02:19.230
Finally, the two Gods face each other.

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:27.090
Athena! Sacrificing Your Life

00:02:36.740 --> 00:02:39.530
I'm not completely defeated yet.

00:02:41.150 --> 00:02:46.940
I won't go down as long as the
fire in my soul keeps burning.

00:02:47.010 --> 00:02:49.190
Pegasus Meteor Punch!

00:02:51.750 --> 00:02:56.060
Either you don't know when to
give up or you're just suicidal.

00:02:56.630 --> 00:03:03.540
Fine, then I'll completely defeat you.
I'll blow out that fire in your soul.

00:03:03.810 --> 00:03:05.460
Take this, Pegasus!

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:08.410
Greed for Life!

00:03:19.430 --> 00:03:22.410
I see. So that's the Athena Cloth.

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:25.910
With it, victory is certain.

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:29.930
Miss Pandora will be pleased.

00:03:32.030 --> 00:03:37.310
What? He moved even after being
hit by my Greed for Life.

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:41.500
No, he's completely passed out.

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:44.940
He's unconscious but he
still hasn't given up.

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:52.620
Let go. Let go!

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:56.120
That Cloth is no use to you anymore.

00:03:56.120 --> 00:03:57.060
Let go!

00:03:57.760 --> 00:04:02.310
Let go! Let go!

00:04:02.630 --> 00:04:04.210
Damn! Why won't you let go?

00:04:16.240 --> 00:04:18.770
This man still holds on.

00:04:20.160 --> 00:04:22.990
This is the definition of stubborn.

00:04:23.690 --> 00:04:27.470
Even the ultimate Gold Saints lie here.

00:04:28.230 --> 00:04:30.010
No matter how much you retaliate.

00:04:30.210 --> 00:04:36.540
Now that Lord Hades has awakened,
there is no future for you.

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:40.250
I'll take Athena's Cloth
by force if I need to.

00:04:46.210 --> 00:04:47.540
What is this?

00:04:48.110 --> 00:04:54.560
Pegasus was as cold as ice, but
now he's burning like fire.

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:55.730
Seiya.

00:04:56.950 --> 00:04:58.340
Seiya.

00:04:59.190 --> 00:05:00.370
Seiya.

00:05:03.460 --> 00:05:05.110
This Cosmo

00:05:05.960 --> 00:05:08.920
is Athena.

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:15.390
I must deliver the Athena
Cloth to defeat Hades.

00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:18.760
I must get it to Athena.

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:21.310
I can't believe it.

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:28.150
A tremendous Cosmo is emanating
from the near-dead body of Pegasus.

00:05:28.150 --> 00:05:29.070
Why?

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:32.980
There's no time to waste. This is it!

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:34.610
Greed for...

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:44.370
Fool! How many times do I have to say
your weak kick won't even scratch me?

00:05:51.020 --> 00:05:52.350
Pegasus.

00:05:56.460 --> 00:06:00.890
I won't stop. I can't stop here.

00:06:01.990 --> 00:06:06.720
This Cloth. I must deliver
this Cloth to Athena!

00:06:19.250 --> 00:06:20.730
This Cosmo.

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:25.360
There's no mistake. It's here for Lord Hades.

00:06:26.050 --> 00:06:30.540
No. It has come to the Underworld
to attack Lord Hades.

00:06:41.190 --> 00:06:42.260
Athena.

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:50.460
So you've finally appeared,
to offer your life to Hades.

00:06:50.690 --> 00:06:53.870
Athena, it's dangerous to come out now.

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:58.460
I will take care of Hades,
so please take refuge.

00:06:58.700 --> 00:07:04.410
I cannot. The body of Lord
Hades belongs to Shun.

00:07:05.720 --> 00:07:09.110
No, that is no longer Shun.

00:07:09.620 --> 00:07:14.550
His body and soul has been
totally taken over by Hades.

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:17.060
It's just the shell of Shun.

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:21.590
The real Shun is dead.

00:07:21.590 --> 00:07:25.960
Moreover, he is praying
that we defeat Hades here.

00:07:29.690 --> 00:07:36.430
Even if we attack now, we won't
be able to really defeat Hades.

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:41.380
To add insult to injury, we will
only be damaging Shun's body.

00:07:45.660 --> 00:07:46.690
Athena.

00:07:46.890 --> 00:07:51.680
You must not attack. Understood, Shaka?

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:54.120
Athena.

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:14.840
If you get any closer, he'll get you!

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:21.810
No! Could it be?

00:08:31.670 --> 00:08:32.770
Hades.

00:08:33.670 --> 00:08:37.670
I have come here to ask you a favor.

00:08:38.380 --> 00:08:40.330
A favor?

00:08:54.880 --> 00:09:00.370
Please stop the Greatest Eclipse.

00:09:01.640 --> 00:09:05.560
I want you to prevent the
world from going dark.

00:09:06.970 --> 00:09:07.980
Athena.

00:09:09.740 --> 00:09:12.440
I never thought that you,

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:15.150
whom I have fought since
the beginning of time,

00:09:15.210 --> 00:09:17.200
would ask me for a favor.

00:09:22.010 --> 00:09:23.260
But it's too late.

00:09:26.490 --> 00:09:29.890
The Greatest Eclipse has
already been set into motion.

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:36.640
The sun will be blocked by the moon and
the Earth will be shrouded in darkness

00:09:36.640 --> 00:09:38.890
in a matter of minutes.

00:09:47.750 --> 00:09:50.400
No one can stop it.

00:09:50.710 --> 00:09:54.240
Even with your power, Athena.

00:09:55.120 --> 00:10:01.660
I know. That's why I am asking
you. Even if it costs me my life.

00:10:03.610 --> 00:10:04.550
Please.

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:11.360
Even if it costs you your life? Are
you willing to sacrifice yourself?

00:10:11.740 --> 00:10:12.660
Athena.

00:10:12.930 --> 00:10:16.800
Yes, if the world will be
spared by giving up my life.

00:10:27.920 --> 00:10:31.200
Fine, I will take your life.

00:10:43.900 --> 00:10:49.160
Virgo Shaka, was it? Take
that spear and kill Athena.

00:10:49.310 --> 00:10:50.750
What?

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:54.960
Did you not hear me? I told you to kill her.

00:10:57.380 --> 00:11:02.820
What's wrong? Athena said she would
give up her life to save the world.

00:11:02.980 --> 00:11:04.590
Kill her with gratitude.

00:11:07.300 --> 00:11:12.280
Will you not fulfill her wish?
Is that the way of a Saint?

00:11:13.260 --> 00:11:17.450
Yes. I will be glad to kill.

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:22.470
Hades! I'll be glad to kill you!

00:11:23.010 --> 00:11:24.280
You must not, Shaka!

00:11:27.960 --> 00:11:29.130
Athena!

00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:33.000
I told you, you must not attack.

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:39.600
Amongst the Saints, I heard
that Shaka was honorable.

00:11:39.700 --> 00:11:42.660
But to attack a God is unforgivable.

00:11:47.470 --> 00:11:50.170
I will kill you first.

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:58.900
Hades, it is me whom you are after.

00:11:59.160 --> 00:12:06.410
Move, Athena. If you don't, this
spear will go through you and Shaka.

00:12:07.170 --> 00:12:08.070
I will not move.

00:12:08.430 --> 00:12:12.150
Fine, I will take both of your lives!

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:17.030
I will kill you both!

00:12:17.190 --> 00:12:18.250
Athena!

00:12:27.380 --> 00:12:34.020
I applaud you for igniting your
remaining Cosmo to attack me.

00:12:34.380 --> 00:12:40.730
But now you don't have any
Cosmo left. This is it.

00:12:43.510 --> 00:12:46.740
Not yet. Not yet!

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:51.130
I see. You are determined.

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:56.160
I'm impressed by your loyalty to Athena.

00:12:56.370 --> 00:13:00.830
But I am a man who offered
his loyalty to Lord Hades.

00:13:00.900 --> 00:13:03.800
I will convey it to you
with my ultimate attack!

00:13:04.870 --> 00:13:06.620
Greed for Life!

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:25.190
Damn it! Why won't you die?

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:26.830
Athena.

00:13:28.400 --> 00:13:30.320
This is the final blow, Pegasus!

00:13:35.170 --> 00:13:36.820
Take it again!

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:39.800
Athena, give me strength!

00:13:43.210 --> 00:13:44.930
Greed for Life!

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:47.290
Pegasus Meteor Punch!

00:13:55.840 --> 00:13:57.320
Impossible.

00:13:57.860 --> 00:14:04.290
How can he produce such
a Cosmo in the Cocytus?

00:14:06.290 --> 00:14:07.400
I did it.

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:12.050
Miss Saori.

00:14:17.340 --> 00:14:18.420
Athena.

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:33.040
What's wrong, Athena? Weren't you going
to sacrifice yourself for the world?

00:14:33.480 --> 00:14:36.600
Or is your life too precious?

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:41.320
Stopping the Greatest Eclipse comes first.

00:14:41.840 --> 00:14:46.440
Now, stop the Greatest
Eclipse immediately, Hades!

00:14:51.690 --> 00:14:54.120
I won't let you kill anyone before then.

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:56.920
Shaka, Shun, or anyone else.

00:14:57.130 --> 00:15:02.530
I have a duty to protect all living things.

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:06.600
That is why I was born in this era!

00:15:09.130 --> 00:15:12.760
What is this? It's hot like fire.

00:15:13.040 --> 00:15:14.390
Athena's blood is hot!

00:15:17.750 --> 00:15:21.180
Hades was in pain as soon as he came
in contact with Athena's blood.

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:28.500
Hades' hair color is changing.

00:15:34.020 --> 00:15:35.120
I feel it.

00:15:35.520 --> 00:15:36.820
Athena.

00:15:37.730 --> 00:15:38.890
I feel it.

00:15:39.160 --> 00:15:46.430
After receiving my blood, Shun's lost
Cosmo is coming back from within.

00:15:50.610 --> 00:15:53.350
You can do it. Wake up, Shun!

00:15:53.510 --> 00:15:58.400
Expel the soul of Hades that
resides within your body.

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:01.560
Athena.

00:16:01.990 --> 00:16:05.570
Now, Hades, leave Shun's body!

00:16:07.280 --> 00:16:11.580
I can't stay in this body any longer!

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:13.290
Wake up, Shun.

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:17.040
The Andromeda Saint of hope!

00:16:27.720 --> 00:16:29.170
What is that?

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:31.930
Is it the soul of Hades?

00:16:37.020 --> 00:16:42.620
Impossible! Shun's body rejected my soul!

00:16:43.190 --> 00:16:50.020
Shun was destined to be my vessel. So why?

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:55.160
You're wrong. It was you who chose Shun.

00:16:55.470 --> 00:17:00.040
Shun was born into this world
as the Andromeda Saint.

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:03.250
Definitely not to become your body.

00:17:04.020 --> 00:17:10.270
Shun's soul has been awakened by my blood.

00:17:10.450 --> 00:17:13.260
There is no place for you.

00:17:18.800 --> 00:17:19.660
Shun.

00:17:20.130 --> 00:17:21.550
My body.

00:17:22.270 --> 00:17:27.060
Give it up, Hades. You chose
the wrong time to resurrect.

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:29.060
What?

00:17:29.540 --> 00:17:33.310
You do not have the flesh
to come back to Earth.

00:17:33.850 --> 00:17:37.530
You will never to be able to fully
resurrect yourself in this era!

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:42.000
Now, you know fighting any further is futile.

00:17:42.130 --> 00:17:48.350
Stop the Greatest Eclipse and
return back to sleep, Hades.

00:17:49.620 --> 00:17:53.110
I was moments away from
making the world go dark.

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:58.420
I cannot go back without
the world in my hands!

00:18:03.610 --> 00:18:06.110
Just as you did to me,

00:18:06.360 --> 00:18:10.470
Athena, I will ravage your body!

00:18:10.910 --> 00:18:12.820
Athena!

00:18:14.830 --> 00:18:16.370
Watch out, Athena!

00:18:16.510 --> 00:18:17.700
Hades!

00:18:26.430 --> 00:18:28.930
Is this the end of Hades?

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:37.600
The Greatest Eclipse will stop!
Peace will now be realized on Earth!

00:18:47.980 --> 00:18:49.130
Athena!

00:18:51.400 --> 00:18:54.420
Athena!

00:18:55.460 --> 00:18:56.740
What's this light?

00:18:57.330 --> 00:19:00.010
What are the Gods doing?

00:19:08.740 --> 00:19:10.740
The Cosmo are disappearing.

00:19:11.730 --> 00:19:15.120
What happened to Lord Hades and Athena?

00:19:24.090 --> 00:19:26.520
Diamond Dust!

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:32.920
Rising Dragon Punch!

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:45.550
Did you feel it, Shiryu?

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:49.110
Yes, there is no mistake. This Cosmo.

00:19:49.110 --> 00:19:50.460
Is Athena's.

00:19:50.740 --> 00:19:54.100
And it's vanishing.

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:56.250
Could something have happened to Miss Saori?

00:19:57.410 --> 00:19:58.220
Athena.

00:19:59.660 --> 00:20:01.500
Miss Saori!

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:09.140
Athena's Cosmo.

00:20:14.160 --> 00:20:17.550
Not only Athena, but Lord Hades' Cosmo too.

00:20:18.410 --> 00:20:20.020
It's about to disappear.

00:20:25.480 --> 00:20:26.470
Athena.

00:20:36.260 --> 00:20:38.880
I have to go to Athena.

00:20:39.700 --> 00:20:41.960
To Miss Saori.

00:20:52.030 --> 00:20:52.990
What's this?

00:20:55.350 --> 00:20:59.160
Athena. Miss Saori's Cosmo.

00:21:00.290 --> 00:21:01.600
Miss Saori.

00:21:01.950 --> 00:21:03.110
Seiya.

00:21:04.740 --> 00:21:08.270
Miss Saori's Cosmo is disappearing.

00:21:12.110 --> 00:21:14.990
Could she have been done in by Hades?

00:21:16.360 --> 00:21:18.090
Did I not make it?

00:21:19.330 --> 00:21:22.410
The Athena Cloth that Shion
and Saga entrusted me with...

00:21:22.910 --> 00:21:25.680
And all my friends who
fought in the Underworld...

00:21:28.300 --> 00:21:30.220
Was it all in vain?

00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:34.370
I can't do anything anymore.

00:21:37.640 --> 00:21:42.510
To save Miss Saori. Or
bring peace to the world.

00:21:42.510 --> 00:21:45.940
To reunite with my sister. Everything.

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:51.230
Miss Saori. Miss Saori!

00:21:52.720 --> 00:21:56.140
Miss Saori!

00:21:58.400 --> 00:22:01.670
Miss Saori.

00:24:04.110 --> 00:24:07.370
After our rigorous battles, we reach
the final destination in the Underworld.

00:24:07.370 --> 00:24:09.820
A place where only Gods can pass through.

00:24:10.100 --> 00:24:13.760
Even the Gold Saint Shaka
was no match for it.

00:24:14.010 --> 00:24:17.890
Something that bears despair
threatens to destroy the Saints' hope.

00:24:18.270 --> 00:24:20.550
No, we will not give up...

00:24:20.550 --> 00:24:23.110
Not until we get Athena's Cloth to Saori-san!

00:24:23.510 --> 00:24:26.430
Saint Seiya:
"Desperation at the Wailing Wall."

00:24:26.780 --> 00:24:29.150
Have you ever felt your Cosmo?
